# Unsplash photos

Ten photos from [Unsplash](https://unsplash.com), downloaded at 2400 px wide, free to use under the [Unsplash License](https://unsplash.com/license). Use these for the site's images: import the ones you want into the media library. Credit the photographer where it fits, e.g. in a caption.

| File | What it shows | Photographer | Unsplash page |
|---|---|---|---|
| `usb-cables.jpg` | Four USB cable plugs, black and white, on a grey background with lots of empty space | Hal Gatewood | https://unsplash.com/photos/QM9yzAoX-GQ |
| `orange-usb-cables.jpg` | Bundled orange USB cables | Lucian Alexe | https://unsplash.com/photos/yh0UtueiZ-I |
| `code-on-screen.jpg` | A screen full of colourful source code | Chris Ried | https://unsplash.com/photos/ieic5Tq8YMk |
| `laptop-desk-code.jpg` | A laptop with code on screen on a busy desk | Christopher Gower | https://unsplash.com/photos/m_HRfLhgABo |
| `network-lines-dots.jpg` | Abstract blue network of lines and dots | Conny Schneider | https://unsplash.com/photos/xuTJZ7uD7PI |
| `connected-structure.jpg` | Connected metal structure seen from below, like a network graph | Alina Grubnyak | https://unsplash.com/photos/ZiQkhI7417A |
| `circuit-board.jpg` | Macro shot of a black circuit board | Alexandre Debiève | https://unsplash.com/photos/FO7JIlwjOtU |
| `puzzle-piece-slot.jpg` | A dark puzzle piece above its matching, lit slot | Edge2Edge Media | https://unsplash.com/photos/x21KgBfOd_4 |
| `puzzle-hands.jpg` | Two hands fitting puzzle pieces together | Vardan Papikyan | https://unsplash.com/photos/JzE1dHEaAew |
| `cubes.jpg` | A group of cubes on a black surface | Shubham Dhage | https://unsplash.com/photos/T9rKvI3N0NM |
